     indexname     |                                                      indexdef                                                      
-------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 vamana_params_idx | CREATE INDEX vamana_params_idx ON public.t USING vamana (val halfvec_l2_ops) WITH (graph_degree='64', alpha='120')
